OL,3,GNEWSABin lorry fire sparked by
OL,4,Adiscarded battery pack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has issued a safety warning
OL,7,Fafter one of its bin lorries was badly
OL,8,Fdamaged by a fire believed to have been
OL,9,Fstarted by a discarded battery pack.
OL,11,FThe vehicle - carrying out a paper and
OL,12,Fcardboard collection - caught fire in
OL,13,FStranraer last week.
OL,15,FEmergency services were called out and
OL,16,Fthe fire brought under control.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
