OL,3,GNEWSABin lorry fire sparked by
OL,4,Adiscarded battery pack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDumfries and Galloway Council (DGC)
OL,7,Fsaid no staff were injured and the crew
OL,8,Fwere able to get out safely but it
OL,9,Furged people to keep batteries and
OL,10,Fvapes out of their household waste and
OL,11,Frecycling bins after the incident.
